# Brand Analysis Dashboard

A data analysis and visualization project developed to analyze brand performance and present meaningful insights through interactive dashboards and graphical representations.

## Features

- Data collection and preprocessing
- Brand performance analysis
- Data visualization using charts and graphs
- Trend identification and comparison
- Interactive dashboard creation

## Technologies Used

- Data Analysis
- Data Visualization
- Microsoft Excel
- Dashboard Development

## Project Objective

The objective of this project is to analyze brand-related data and visualize key metrics to support data-driven decision making.

## Outcome

- Generated meaningful business insights
- Improved understanding of data visualization techniques
- Developed interactive and user-friendly dashboards
- Enhanced analytical and reporting skills
